      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The group banner that appears above user nameplates has unexpected scaling behaviour. \n\nThe image in the banner is scaling to accomodate for different nameplate lengths. It is scaling by anchoring the bottom edge and moving the top edge. This is unexpected because it offsets the center point of the image, causing content to become cut off.\n\nYou can verify this by using a square aspect UV Checker Texture.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
