      "mergeID": "63c6eab1d605584e29f64726",
      "mergedPostDetails": "[#1 screen is a third person view.]\n\nThe text on the banner image itself is perfectly centered, but in the UI it's offset lower. When you open your Quick Menu and full nameplates show up the banner gets offset higher.\n\n[#2 screen is first person view.]\n\nThe banner centering looks correct when looking at your own nameplate, but its background is set as transparent and it just looks weird with how the cropped corners are stil there and the user icon overlaps the banner.",
