      "mergeID": "63c6ea4850d58d7c11aa1590",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I generally like the group feature.\n\nThe banner above the nameplate was one of the things that seemed particularly attractive to me when I was experimenting with the group feature.\n\nBy the way, I noticed an issue when I was trying out the banner with my friends. By the way, there is an issue that I noticed when I was experimenting with the banner with my fellow members.\n\n1. there is a difference between the banner over my head and the banner over someone else's head. I believe this is probably due to the fact that the reference position for displaying the banner is not standardized.\n\n2. In cases where the status message is somewhat long, the expansion rate of the banner increases. This is when the ESC menu is not displayed; if the status message is long, the nameplate also stretches long, and I wonder if this is the cause.\n\nI would like the group banner to always look the same no matter who is looking at whom. We look forward to the development of this new endeavor. Thank you.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1275]UI problem in Groups banner",
